Modifications made in this fork (gold/MT5 adaptation):
- New "commodity" asset type and gold symbol classification (cli/).
- Commodity-mode fundamentals analyst using macro/FRED drivers instead of
  company financials (tradingagents/agents/analysts/fundamentals_analyst.py).
- Gold-aware instrument context (tradingagents/agents/utils/agent_utils.py).
- Gold-relevant FRED macro series and a point-in-time series accessor
  (tradingagents/dataflows/fred.py).
- New tradingagents/gold_config.py, tradingagents/brokers/ (MetaTrader 5
  broker integration and gold order executor), gold_mt5.py runner, and
  associated tests and documentation.
- New deterministic gold system (tradingagents/gold/): indicators, market
  structure, multi-timeframe hierarchy, sessions, news blackout, fundamentals
  and news collection with provenance, SL/TP level construction, risk-based
  position sizing, the deterministic risk engine (final trade authority),
  paper trading, backtesting with walk-forward split, persistent safety
  state, and auditable reporting.
- `tradingagents gold analyze` CLI subcommand and runner modes
  (analysis-only / paper / backtest / dry-run / live).

The original upstream README is preserved as UPSTREAM_README.md.
